  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 513.09 Design Requirements for Docking Structures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 513.09 Design Requirements for Docking Structures. In addition to meeting the applicable application requirements of Env-Wt 300, all docking structures shall meet the applicable requirements specified in Env-Wt 513.10, Env-Wt 513.11, Env-Wt 513.14, and Env-Wt 513.22.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
